 2. 👨🏽‍💻 AI could force millions into new roles 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Illustration: Allie Carl/Axios Roughly 11 million American workers might need to change jobs over the next decade as the economy adapts to the AI era, Axios' Emily Peck writes from a new McKinsey Global Institute estimate. 

 🧑‍🔧 By the numbers: About 7% of current employees might need to shift occupations, the model found. 

 Many who don't switch jobs will still see their work transformed by AI: About 70% of U.S. workers will face some level of role reinvention. Read the report . 

 
 
