 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Jack Smith arrives to testify on Capitol Hill today. Photo: Win McNamee/Getty Images 🏛️ Former special counsel Jack Smith defended his prosecutions of President Trump and his investigative tactics, pushing back in a Senate hearing today against Republican efforts to paint him and his team as partisan operators. Go deeper . 💍 Smart ring maker Oura delayed an IPO that had been expected to raise up to $2.2 billion, citing "market conditions." More from Dan Primack . 👩‍💼 Fast Company is launching a private WhatsApp community for women balancing senior-level careers and motherhood, Axios' Kerry Flynn reports exclusively. Go deeper . 
 
